                      "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50587500",
                      "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50587500",
                      "textRawHtml": "Anthropic claims to have a 1/7 the size version somewhere.\n<a href=\"https://claude.dev/blog/safely-scaling-multi-agent-teams-with-fable-5-2/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://claude.dev/blog/safely-scaling-multi-agent-teams-wit...</a>",
                      "textZhHtml": "Anthropic claims to have a 1/7 the size version somewhere.\n<a href=\"https://claude.dev/blog/safely-scaling-multi-agent-teams-with-fable-5-2/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://claude.dev/blog/safely-scaling-multi-agent-teams-wit...</a>",
