              "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50581274",
              "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50581274",
              "textRawHtml": "I am a hobbyist home-server-builder and would love to know more about you and your company. I love hearing cases where you as an employee get direct access to the hardware. can you share any more details? I'm kind of spazzing out right now with how casually you said some wildly awesome stuff.",
              "textZhHtml": "I am a hobbyist home-server-builder and would love to know more about you and your company. I love hearing cases where you as an employee get direct access to the hardware. can you share any more details? I'm kind of spazzing out right now with how casually you said some wildly awesome stuff.",
